    "title": "Is Solo Ball related to Lonzo, LaMelo Ball? How UConn star fits into March Madness compared to Ball brothers",
    "text": "Is Solo Ball related to Lonzo, LaMelo Ball? How UConn star fits into March Madness compared to Ball brothers originally appeared on The Sporting News. Add The Sporting News as a Preferred Source by clicking here.Solo Ball has one of the coolest names in college basketball.AdvertisementAnd each time he takes the court for the UConn Huskies men's basketball team, fans want to know if he's a Ball brother -- as in Lonzo, LaMelo and LiAngelo.Those sons of LaVar Ball all had varying degrees of basketball fame.Solo is hoping to have his own.MORE: A crazy link between Bill Murray, Illinois, UConn and Duke's Jon ScheyerNo, Solo Ball isn't a Ball brother of Lonzo, LaMelo and LiAngelo.He's got a high-end Division I basketball game, himself, but he's not from that family.What is Solo Ball's real name?Solo Ball was born Solomon Ball.AdvertisementAccording to the Hartford Courant, Ball sometimes got made fun of for his last name in elementary school.But by the time he was in high school, and was going by Solo Ball full time, he realized he had something cool on his hands.“I didn’t really notice until like my freshman, sophomore year (of high school) how much the name really flows,” Ball said. “I feel like I grew into the name a little bit, so I think that’s kind of cool about it.\"He'll hope to write his name in college basketball history apart from the trio of Ball brothers.MORE: Alex Karaban in NCAA hoops history with Bill Russell, Lew Alcindor",
